<img alt="Rocky" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548199973-03cce0bbc87b?w=600&amp;h=420&amp;fit=crop"/>
<div class="card-badge badge-inprogress"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> En proceso</div>
</div>
<div class="card-body">
<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-1">
